---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro'; const description='InputChecks privacy information and local test-data handling.';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" {description} path="/privacy"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Privacy'}]}/><article class="content"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated: September 10, 2026</p><h2>Test data</h2><p>Mouse wheel events, pointer movement, and click timing used by these tools are processed locally in your browser. We do not send individual test samples to our servers or provide saved test records.</p><h2>Analytics and advertising</h2><p>If analytics is enabled, it records limited product-level actions such as starting or completing a test, not detailed input traces. If advertising is enabled in the future, third-party advertising technologies may process data according to their own policies. Appropriate consent controls should be used where required.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, contact the site operator through the contact method published with the live site.</p></article></BaseLayout>
